Z||000000||87ECO5||11-28-2000||10:00 AM||||Wanted to give everyone an update on the progress of the 2001 calendar.<P>Lisa and I began running it Sunday night and ran into a slight glitch.  The red cars were coming out red-orange in color.  Lisa made some changes and ran some new proofs for me to view - which I'll do today.  If all goes as planned, we'll finish running them tonight and have them ready for shipment by week's end.<P>Other than that, I believe they look VERY good and I think you'll all be very happy with them.<P>Thank you for your support and patience.||||reg||1
